   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>Which abolitionist spoke these words in support of the women’s rights movement?</p>\n<blockquote>In this denial of the right to participate in government, not merely the degradation of woman and the perpetuation of a great injustice happens, but the maiming and repudiation of one-half of the moral and intellectual power of the government of the world.</blockquote>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1169392,
     "content_html": "William Lloyd Garrison"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169393,
     "content_html": "Frederick Douglass"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169391,
     "content_html": "Henry Stanton"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169390,
     "content_html": "Wendell Phillips"
    }
